{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33692","headline":"献同年孔郎中 · 林宽","name":"献同年孔郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炊琼爇桂帝关居，卖尽寒衣典尽书。\n驱马每寻霜影里，到门常在鼓声初。\n蟾枝交彩清兰署，鸾佩排光映玉除。\n一顾深恩身未杀，争期皎日负吹嘘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林宽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}